Package: retrobeat
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, libgtk-3-0 | libgtk-3-0t64, libsecret-1-0, libepoxy0
Recommends: libmpv2
Description: Retro-style music player with WebDAV server support
 RetroBeat builds a library from local music folders, streams from WebDAV
 servers (Nextcloud, NAS, rclone/dufs), and brings an optional Windows
 Media Player retro skin with eight visualisations.
 .
 Desktop playback is powered by libmpv. Install the libmpv2 package to
 enable audio output.
